item.description:
After `join_console`: every open request (empty list if none). Use it to rebuild the Live Friction Queue after a refresh.

**Example payload received:**
```json
[
  {
    "session_id": "s1793926166132_1",
    "page_id": "account.step3",
    "handoff_no": 1,
    "share": {
      "step_no": 3,
      "step_title": "Scan your passport chip",
      "trigger": "friction:repeated_errors",
      "last_error": "NFC_READ_FAILED",
      "failed_attempts": 2
    },
    "events": [
      {
        "type": "error:NFC_READ_FAILED",
        "time": "2026-11-06T00:49:26.446Z"
      },
      {
        "type": "error:NFC_READ_FAILED",
        "time": "2026-11-06T00:49:26.442Z"
      },
      {
        "type": "ai_question",
        "time": "2026-11-06T00:49:26.201Z"
      }
    ],
    "requested_at": "2026-11-06T00:49:26.463Z",
    "staff_name": "Sherry Lim"
  }
]
```

